@ToDoList.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5112
@todoId = 1

### List todos (defaults: page 1, 10 per page, sorted by createdAt descending)
GET {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos
Accept: application/json

### List todos with paging, filtering and sorting
GET {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos?page=1&pageSize=5&isCompleted=false&sortBy=title&sortOrder=asc
Accept: application/json

### Invalid paging (returns 400 problem+json)
GET {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos?page=0&pageSize=500

###

### Get one todo
GET {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos/{{todoId}}
Accept: application/json

### Get a todo that does not exist (returns 404 problem+json)
GET {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos/999999

###

### Create a todo (returns 201 with a Location header)
POST {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn LINQ",
  "description": "Practice filtering",
  "deadline": "2026-11-01T00:00:00Z"
}

### Create a todo without a title (returns 400 problem+json)
POST {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "description": "This should not be created"
}

###

### Replace a todo (PUT is a full replacement; only description and deadline may be omitted)
PUT {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn ASP.NET Core",
  "description": "Practice CRUD operations",
  "isCompleted": true,
  "deadline": "2026-10-25T00:00:00Z"
}

### Replace without isCompleted (returns 400: the field is required)
PUT {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn ASP.NET Core",
  "description": "Practice CRUD operations"
}

###

### Partial update: change only the title
PATCH {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Learn LINQ deeply"
}

### Partial update: clear the description
PATCH {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": null
}

### Partial update: clear the deadline
PATCH {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deadline": null
}

### Partial update with an unknown field (returns 400: unknown members are rejected)
PATCH {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titel": "typo"
}

###

### Delete a todo (returns 204, or 404 when it is already gone)
DELETE {{ToDoList.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Todos/{{todoId}}
